1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:07,000
Section B, Activity 2B. Read the following letter.

2
00:00:08,680 --> 00:00:11,060
Underline the subjects you May likes.

3
00:00:11,720 --> 00:00:15,020
Circle the subjects she doesn't like.

4
00:00:15,620 --> 00:00:18,420
Are you May's ideas the same as yours?

5
00:00:20,020 --> 00:00:24,340
Dear Jenny, I am very busy on Friday.

6
00:00:24,960 --> 00:00:29,400
At 8, I have math. It is not fun.

7
00:00:29,400 --> 00:00:35,520
The teacher says it is useful, but I think it is difficult.

8
00:00:37,120 --> 00:00:41,840
Then at 9, I have science. It is difficult,

9
00:00:41,880 --> 00:00:43,440
but interesting.

10
00:00:44,360 --> 00:00:48,340
At 10, I have history. After that,

11
00:00:48,500 --> 00:00:53,720
I have P.E. at 11. It is easy and fun.

12
00:00:53,720 --> 00:00:58,580
Lunch is from 12 to 1, and after that,

13
00:00:58,820 --> 00:01:02,800
we have Chinese. It is my favorite subject.

14
00:01:03,880 --> 00:01:06,220
Our Chinese teacher, Mrs. Wang,

15
00:01:06,300 --> 00:01:07,940
is great fun.

16
00:01:08,800 --> 00:01:13,240
My class is finished at 1.50, but after that,

17
00:01:13,240 --> 00:01:19,340
I have an art lesson for two hours. It is really relaxing.

18
00:01:20,340 --> 00:01:24,040
How about you? When are your classes?

19
00:01:25,300 --> 00:01:27,300
What is your favorite subject?

20
00:01:28,380 --> 00:01:30,040
Your friend, you May.
